#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:5
#: ff234ea87cdd4a82b60b12575c3e0ffe
msgid "Auxiliary Function Switches (3.6 and earlier)"
msgstr "辅助功能开关（3.6及更早版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:7
#: 329e6281cc784beaa4d7270d5d0082f2
msgid "this article is deprecated and ARCHIVED"
msgstr "本文已弃用并已归档"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:9
#: 0e9914eeebf3461ebd7e5f753325fc89
msgid ""
"This article shows how to set up which features are invoked from the "
"transmitter's auxiliary function switches prior to Copter-4.0."
msgstr "本文介绍如何在Copter-4.0之前的版本中设置从遥控器辅助功能开关启用的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:12
#: d1c24d997fa74044871da0bb70be7155
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:14
#: 447604b154d84cc4a4638d05a84b0d5b
msgid ""
"By default the auxiliary switches are disabled but you can assign features "
"using the *Mission Planner*'s **Config/Tuning \\| Extended Tuning** screen "
"or by setting the CH7_OPT,  CH8_OPT, CH9_OPT, CH10_OPT , CH11_OPT, or "
"CH12_OPT parameters directly."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下辅助开关被禁用，但您可以使用 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Extended "
"Tuning** 界面，或直接设置CH7_OPT、CH8_OPT、CH9_OPT、CH10_OPT、CH11_OPT或CH12_OPT参数来分配功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:22
#: fd841fe213fc49ca968c09247f01b126
msgid "Here are the options:"
msgstr "以下是选项："

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:43
#: 88c40d4e776941f5a08a0428fd605705
msgid ""
"The copter moves left, right, forward and back as if it were facing in the "
"same direction as when it took off regardless of the copter's heading. "
":ref:`See here for more details <simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器左、右、前、后移动，就像朝向起飞时相同方向一样，无论飞行器实际航向如何。:ref:`详情见此 <simpleandsuper-simple-"
"modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:55
#: 566475db12fa4492812581a8b194dc64
msgid ""
"Invokes the :ref:`Return-to-Launch <rtl-mode>` flight mode when switch is "
"pulled high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode"
" indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr "开关拨高时启动 :ref:`返航 <rtl-mode>` 飞行模式。将开关拨回低位将使飞行器返回CH5飞行模式开关指示的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:66
#: b656ae401b214375a1d0f98deda460b6
msgid ""
"Adjust the vehicle level position using the current roll and pitch stick "
"inputs. See details `here <autotrim>`__."
msgstr "使用当前横滚和俯仰摇杆输入调整飞行器水平位置。详情见 `此处 <autotrim>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:82
#: 8d3da931a02445769b5803b2cb7dddf4
msgid ""
"Camera shutter will be activated. See more details :ref:`here <common-"
"camera-shutter-with-servo>`."
msgstr "相机快门将被激活。更多详情请参见 :ref:`此处 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:93
#: 33bbacff51b24a4cad9622881400de00
msgid ""
":ref:`RangeFinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` is disabled when switch "
"is in low position, enabled when in high position."
msgstr ":ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 开关在低位时禁用，在高位时启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:107
#: c64fd88d51b74614ac2ac5125729cde5
msgid ""
"Similar to simple mode except controls are relative to the home position. "
"Move the pitch stick forward and the copter will fly away from home, pull "
"pitch back and it will return. Move roll stick left or right and the copter "
"to orbit home regardless of the copter's actual heading. :ref:`See here for "
"more details <simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`."
msgstr ""
"与Simple模式类似，但控制相对于Home位置。将俯仰摇杆向前推，飞行器将飞离Home；将俯仰拉回，它将返回。无论飞行器实际航向如何，横滚摇杆左右移动将使飞行器围绕Home旋转。:ref:`详情见此"
" <simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:113
#: b2553e5e1dcb4c2a846ce33f2569e5a0
msgid ""
"If mapped to a three-position switch then the function will allow Super-"
"Simple **and Simple** modes to be enabled using the high and middle switch "
"positions, respectively (a two-position switch will enable/disable Super "
"Simple mode only)."
msgstr ""
"如果映射到三段开关，则该功能将分别允许使用高位和中间开关位置启用Super Simple **和Simple** 模式（两段开关只能启用/禁用Super"
" Simple模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:126
#: 4944fb6f554e4122bd4c690e67a14c17
msgid "Turn on automatic leveling in the :ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>` flight mode."
msgstr "在 :ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>` 飞行模式中开启自动调平。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:136
#: c605b7e4128d481297dc15f5532035fa
msgid "Turn on the :ref:`crop sprayer <sprayer>` when switch is pulled high."
msgstr "开关拨高时开启 :ref:`喷洒器 <sprayer>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:146
#: 721558019b53448d91502c5f68aba866
msgid ""
"Invokes the :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` flight mode when switch is pulled high. "
"Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by"
" the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr "开关拨高时启动 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 飞行模式。将开关拨回低位将使飞行器返回CH5飞行模式开关指示的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:157
#: d86538ebff8647b5960223360e45c7a8
msgid ""
"Invokes the :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` flight mode when switch is pulled "
"high. Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode "
"indicated by the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr "开关拨高时启动 :ref:`AutoTune <autotune>` 飞行模式。将开关拨回低位将使飞行器返回CH5飞行模式开关指示的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:168
#: be83688502794dc4aff3640fd6b437b9
msgid ""
"Invokes the :ref:`Land <land-mode>` flight mode when switch is pulled high. "
"Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by"
" the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr "开关拨高时启动 :ref:`Land <land-mode>` 飞行模式。将开关拨回低位将使飞行器返回CH5飞行模式开关指示的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:179
#: e24afcd7c21749e4bf68ae72f9ce6834
msgid ""
"Operates the :ref:`gripper <common-gripper-landingpage>`.  Switch pulled low"
" releases the gripper, high closes or grabs."
msgstr "操作 :ref:`抓取器 <common-gripper-landingpage>`。开关拨低释放抓取器，拨高关闭或抓取。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:189
#: 34e688cef0694bb7b9ce831f5100d2df
msgid ""
"Enables the automatic release of the :ref:`parachute <common-parachute>` "
"(this does not immediately trigger the release)."
msgstr "启用 :ref:`降落伞 <common-parachute>` 的自动释放（这不会立即触发释放）。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:199
#: 3b91e2a49a5048bbaa222f9cf0eb9b0f
msgid ""
"Immediately triggers the release of the :ref:`parachute <common-parachute>` "
"as long as the vehicle is not landed or too low."
msgstr "立即触发 :ref:`降落伞 <common-parachute>` 释放，只要飞行器没有着陆或不在过低位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:209
#: b34f3f90cb0945019da80bae929761a6
msgid ""
"Switch pulled low disables the :ref:`parachute <common-parachute>`.  Switch "
"in middle enables the parachute for automatic release.  Switch pulled high "
"triggers release of the parachute as long as vehicle is not landed or too "
"low."
msgstr ""
"开关拨低禁用 :ref:`降落伞 <common-"
"parachute>`。开关置中启用降落伞自动释放。开关拨高触发降落伞释放，只要飞行器没有着陆或不在过低位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:219
#: 5259d24fe049497aa5574bc25777167a
msgid ""
"Reset :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` to run the first mission command in the "
"command list."
msgstr "重置 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 以运行指令列表中的第一条任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:239
#: ab1e0c6454474282a5d77edea13c520a
msgid ""
"Move the :ref:`camera mount <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` to its retracted "
"position."
msgstr "将 :ref:`云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 移动到其收起位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:249
#: ecc8065bc8f14073be3408adfc6fe4fd
msgid ""
"Switch pulled low turns off the first :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled "
"high turns on the first relay."
msgstr "开关拨低时关闭第一个 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>`，拨高时打开第一个继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:259
#: 1d8e8a97b4a24ce8ba07b19d5837e48e
msgid ""
"Switch pulled low turns off the second :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled "
"high turns on the second relay."
msgstr "开关拨低时关闭第二个 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>`，拨高时打开第二个继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:269
#: 965232499e9f4f93871864bbf0a72e64
msgid ""
"Switch pulled low turns off the third :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled "
"high turns on the third relay."
msgstr "开关拨低时关闭第三个 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>`，拨高时打开第三个继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:279
#: d97d5e0c46cd4960829d217eba03145f
msgid ""
"Switch pulled low turns off the fourth :ref:`relay <common-relay>`, pulled "
"high turns on the fourth relay."
msgstr "开关拨低时关闭第四个 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>`，拨高时打开第四个继电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:288
#: 5b20405bc7b34a5197309f78377ea6fd
msgid ":ref:`Landing Gear <landing-gear>`"
msgstr ":ref:`起落架 <landing-gear>`"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:300
#: 7215188212ea45839931363e122e16b7
msgid ""
"Plays the `lost copter alarm "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/LostCopter.wav>`__"
" though the buzzer"
msgstr ""
"通过蜂鸣器播放 `飞机丢失警报 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pixhawk_sound_files/LostCopter.wav>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:311
#: 634af2ab05f9492f882bb341019357ac
msgid ""
"Stops motors immediately (`video "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Db4u8LJE5w>`__)."
msgstr "立即停止电机（`视频 <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Db4u8LJE5w>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:322
#: d8a71601fd8249a4b7ea08eddbddda5d
msgid ""
"Opposite of Emergency stop (above) in that switch must be ON for motors to "
"spin (`video <https://youtu.be/-Db4u8LJE5w&t=51s>`__)."
msgstr ""
"与紧急停机（上述）相反，电机要旋转需将开关置于 ON 位置（`视频 <https://youtu.be/-Db4u8LJE5w&t=51s>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:333
#: cf5cd9dc3d0b4eaf9c31310db58e6733
msgid ""
"Invokes the :ref:`Brake flight mode <brake-mode>` when switch goes high. "
"Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by"
" the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""
"开关拨高时切换至 :ref:`Brake 飞行模式 <brake-mode>`。将开关拨回低位将使飞机返回到 ch5 飞行模式开关所指示的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:345
#: 68ada0acafd847f6b11487febd4c47d4
msgid ""
"Invokes the :ref:`Throw flight mode <throw-mode>` when switch goes high. "
"Bringing switch back to low will return the vehicle to the mode indicated by"
" the ch5 flight mode switch."
msgstr ""
"开关拨高时切换至 :ref:`Throw 飞行模式 <throw-mode>`。将开关拨回低位将使飞机返回到 ch5 飞行模式开关所指示的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:357
#: eaa8fdbf05e0455abd3ac9054a5ed182
msgid ""
"When switch is high, :ref:`ADSB avoidance <common-ads-b-receiver>` "
"(avoidance of manned aircraft) is enabled, when switch is low, disabled."
msgstr "开关拨高时启用 :ref:`ADSB 避让 <common-ads-b-receiver>`（避让有人驾驶航空器），开关拨低时禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:367
#: 6117ded255624061bb29e42084041ba7
msgid ""
"Turns on/off :ref:`Precision Loiter <precision-landing-and-loiter>`.  I.e. "
"holding position above a target in Loiter mode."
msgstr ""
"开启/关闭 :ref:`精准 Loiter <precision-landing-and-loiter>`，即在 Loiter "
"模式下保持在目标上方悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:377
#: 47119b25057948c4a514d0304f7dccfb
msgid ""
"When switch is high, avoid objects using :ref:`Lightware SF40c <common-"
"lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance>` or :ref:`TeraRanger Tower<common-"
"teraranger-tower-objectavoidance>`."
msgstr ""
"开关拨高时，使用 :ref:`Lightware SF40c <common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance>` 或 "
":ref:`TeraRanger Tower<common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance>` 避障。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:387
#: 3258cb2d4c674f8e9944327473ec6d0a
msgid ""
"Arms the vehicle if the switch goes high (subject to arming checks). Disarms"
" the vehicle if brought low."
msgstr "开关拨高时解锁飞行器（须通过解锁检查）。开关拨低时上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:398
#: 87b783d319434c689beeacb538418901
msgid "Check Ch7 & Ch8 PWM values reach 1800"
msgstr "检查通道 7 和通道 8 的 PWM 值是否达到 1800"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-7-and-8-options.rst:400
#: 1a9b66669a2c48e685b3b8a83dcdad07
msgid ""
"Your channel 7 and/or channel 8 pwm value must reach at least 1800 PWM or "
"the auxiliary function will not be activated. You can check that it "
"surpasses this threshold using the Mission Planner's radio config page."
msgstr ""
"通道 7 和/或通道 8 的 PWM 值必须至少达到 1800 PWM，否则辅助功能将不会激活。您可以使用 Mission Planner "
"的遥控器配置页面检查其是否超过此阈值。"
